   "statement": "theorem o02e_cyclic_gap_sum (m : ℕ) (a : ℕ → ℝ) (hwrap : a m = a 0 + 2 * Real.pi) :\n    ∑ i ∈ Finset.range m, (a (i + 1) - a i) = 2 * Real.pi",
