  {
   "id": "erdos1084:UPPER:O10",
   "statement": "theorem o10_assemble (k n h e dsum : ℕ)\n    (hn : n = 3 * k ^ 2 + 3 * k + 1)\n    (hhk : 6 * k ≤ h)\n    (hhand : 2 * e = dsum)\n    (hdegsum : dsum + 2 * h + 6 ≤ 6 * n) :\n    e ≤ 9 * k ^ 2 + 3 * k",
   "kind": "LEMMA",
   "depends_on": [
    "erdos1084:UPPER:O05",
    "erdos1084:UPPER:O07",
    "erdos1084:UPPER:O08",
    "erdos1084:UPPER:O09"
   ],
   "binding": "PARAPHRASE",
   "binding_detail": "a typed Lean obligation of the upper-bound ladder, stated over the target's own verbatim definitions",
   "status": "OPEN",
   "obligation": "the four numeric rungs compose to e <= 9k^2+3k at n = 3k^2+3k+1.",
   "proof_status": "LADDER_ATTEMPT",
   "remaining_obligation": "nothing mathematical; only a kernel run.",
   "lean_file": "oracle/evidence/msl-machine/campaigns/erdos1084-harborth-2026-09-02/upper/O10_Assemble.lean",
   "lean_preamble": "import Mathlib\n\nset_option autoImplicit false\nset_option maxHeartbeats 400000\nset_option maxRecDepth 4000\n\n/-!\n# erdos:1084 upper bound -- O10, THE ASSEMBLY\n\nPure arithmetic, subtraction-free over ℕ.  `2e = ∑ deg` (O08+O09), `∑ deg + 2h + 6 ≤ 6n`\n(O05), `n = 3k²+3k+1`, `h ≥ 6k` (O07)  ⇒  `e ≤ 9k² + 3k`.\n\nThe `k ^ 2` is generalised to a fresh variable before `omega`, because `omega` is linear\nand the statement is linear in `k²` once `k²` is an atom.\n\nSTATUS: LADDER_ATTEMPT -- a complete proof is written, not compiled.\n-/\n\nopen Finset Filter Metric Real\nopen scoped Finset ENNReal Classical EuclideanGeometry\n\n",
   "lean_signature": "theorem o10_assemble (k n h e dsum : ℕ)\n    (hn : n = 3 * k ^ 2 + 3 * k + 1)\n    (hhk : 6 * k ≤ h)\n    (hhand : 2 * e = dsum)\n    (hdegsum : dsum + 2 * h + 6 ≤ 6 * n) :\n    e ≤ 9 * k ^ 2 + 3 * k",
   "lean_statement_line": "theorem o10_assemble (k n h e dsum : ℕ)\n    (hn : n = 3 * k ^ 2 + 3 * k + 1)\n    (hhk : 6 * k ≤ h)\n    (hhand : 2 * e = dsum)\n    (hdegsum : dsum + 2 * h + 6 ≤ 6 * n) :\n    e ≤ 9 * k ^ 2 + 3 * k := by\n  obtain ⟨K, hK⟩ : ∃ K : ℕ, k ^ 2 = K := ⟨k ^ 2, rfl⟩\n  rw [hK] at hn ⊢\n  omega",
   "lean_file_sha256": "22f16e68fd6828c7a1208cefbb018373bf4c7f3c80a7735cf331ed75c2563aed",
