   "id": "erdos1084:UPPER:O11",
   "statement": "theorem o11_triangular_optimal_d2 (k : ℕ)\n    (hlow : 9 * k ^ 2 + 3 * k ≤ Erdos1084.f 2 (3 * k ^ 2 + 3 * k + 1))\n    (hupp : Erdos1084.f 2 (3 * k ^ 2 + 3 * k + 1) ≤ 9 * k ^ 2 + 3 * k) :\n    Erdos1084.f 2 (3 * k ^ 2 + 3 * k + 1) = 9 * k ^ 2 + 3 * k",
