   "refutation": {
    "verdict": "the frozen O06 statement is FALSE, exactly as its own scaffold header warned",
    "witness": "four distinct COLLINEAR points listed out of order along the line: (0,0),(2,0),(1,0),(3,0); all four listed angles are 0 so the sum is 0, while (h-2)*pi = 2*pi",
    "why_hypotheses_hold": "hcyclic is vacuous because EuclideanGeometry.angle never exceeds pi; the convex hull of a collinear set has empty interior, so it is its own frontier and hfront holds at every listed point",
