  {
   "id": "erdos1084:UPPER:O02",
   "statement": "theorem o02_cyclic_angular_order (v : ℝ^ 2) (D : Finset (ℝ^ 2))\n    (hunit : ∀ u ∈ D, dist v u = 1)\n    (hsep : ∀ u ∈ D, ∀ w ∈ D, u ≠ w → 1 ≤ dist u w) :\n    ∃ a : ℕ → ℝ,\n      (∀ i, i < D.card → -Real.pi < a i ∧ a i ≤ Real.pi) ∧\n      (∀ i, i + 1 < D.card → a i < a (i + 1)) ∧\n      a D.card = a 0 + 2 * Real.pi ∧\n      (∀ i, i < D.card → Real.pi / 3 ≤ a (i + 1) - a i) ∧\n      ∑ i ∈ Finset.range D.card, (a (i + 1) - a i) = 2 * Real.pi",
   "kind": "LEMMA",
   "depends_on": [
    "erdos1084:UPPER:O01",
