  {
   "id": "erdos1084:UPPER:O02G",
   "statement": "THE GAP CEILING: m consecutive gaps each at least pi/3 summing to 2*pi are each at most 2*pi - (m-1)*pi/3; for m >= 4 that is at most pi, and then the central angles ARE the gaps and sum to 2*pi",
   "kind": "LEMMA",
   "depends_on": [
