  {
   "id": "erdos1084:UPPER:O06H",
   "statement": "THE HANDOFF OBJECT for the H-rungs. From polar data about the interior point (positive radii, coordinates, gaps nonnegative and at most pi, gap sum 2*pi) BOTH hvne and hcentral are DERIVED, so the only remaining input to the interior-angle sum is InsideAngleAt. ne_of_pos_radius + hcentral_of_polar + o06_angle_sum_of_polar_fan.",
   "kind": "LEMMA",
